    "body": "It seems you only support UDP and TCP. However there is another transport mechanism called TURN-TLS, which wraps the whole thing into another TLS layer. This should be the last fallback for ugly company firewalls or so, which do deep package inspection and block non-HTTPS traffic on port 443.",
